B.das=new A.P("mystery","[Set 31] I am seen in mirrors yet never in the same room twice. What am I?","Your reflection leaving")
B.dbz=new A.P("mystery","[Set 31] Doors open for me though I carry no key; time is my ally. What am I? (Think carefully.)","A habit")
B.dc8=new A.P("wordplay","Challenge 960: What word becomes shorter when you add two letters to it?","Short (adding -er)")
B.dbP=new A.P("logic","Logic puzzle #992: a number times itself minus 82 equals 7314. What is the number?","86")
B.dik=new A.P("love","[Set 32] I have a heart that never beats yet lovers chase me across centuries. What am I?","A love letter")
B.dc_=new A.P("love","[Set 32] Two share me but neither owns me alone; without trust I vanish. What am I?","A secret")
B.dhR=new A.P("love","Deep riddle #963 \u2014 I grow when given away in romance yet shrink when hoarded in silence. What am I?","Affection")
B.deW=new A.P("love","[Set 32] I bind no rope yet hold two souls tighter than chains. What am I?","A vow")
B.dfQ=new A.P("love","Challenge 965: Seen in eyes before spoken on lips; I arrive first at every true meeting. What am I?","Recognition")
B.d8X=new A.P("bible","Deep riddle #966 \u2014 I swallowed a man yet could not digest his prayer; I returned him on the third dawn. What am I? (Think carefully.)","The great fish")
B.d58=new A.P("bible","[Set 32] Built with pitch and gopher wood, I rode forty days of rain. What am I?","Noah's ark")
B.d9W=new A.P("bible","[Set 32] I parted for a nation fleeing; walls of me stood like guards then fell flat. What am I?","The Red Sea")
